    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hello @echasnovski, as far as I know currently mini.base16 doesn't support enabling italic/bold for different bases. It limits the ability to customize for color-scheme makers and users. It would be helpful to have such feature.\r\n\r\nThanks.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hello <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/echasnovski/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski\">@echasnovski</a>, as far as I know currently mini.base16 doesn't support enabling italic/bold for different bases. It limits the ability to customize for color-scheme makers and users. It would be helpful to have such feature.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hello @echasnovski, as far as I know currently mini.base16 doesn't support enabling italic/bold for different bases. It limits the ability to customize for color-scheme makers and users. It would be helpful to have such feature.\nThanks.",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
